00:40:49.970 --> 00:40:54.300
Magi Casp, Magi Balthazar, Magi Melchior.

00:40:55.230 --> 00:40:57.370
The Magi are the three aspects of myself.

00:40:57.960 --> 00:40:59.980
Myself as a scientist, my...

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:01.780
