00:41:02.200 --> 00:41:04.600
The three aspects that combine to make one whole.

00:41:04.820 --> 00:41:06.440
The three faces of mother.

00:41:06.700 --> 00:41:09.160
And all that's left to do is to turn the power on.

00:41:09.550 --> 00:41:10.050
Mm-hmm.

00:41:11.380 --> 00:41:13.160
