This is our chance, Spiewski.

01:07:20.950 --> 01:07:22.540
Our chance? But...

01:07:22.540 --> 01:07:27.080
We cannot make time run backwards, but we can spur its course forward with our own hand.

01:07:32.430 --> 01:07:34.110
The old men won't allow this, Sakari.

01:07:34.550 --> 01:07:37.450
Therefore, we must finish this before Sele has time to act.

01:07:38.390 --> 01:07:43.110
After all, it is not acceptable to lose Unit 2 at this time.

01:07:43.400 --> 01:07:47.480
But you just can't use the Lange of Longinus without getting Sele's approval first.

01:07:47.700 --> 01:07:48.720
You're asking for trouble.

01:07:48.880 --> 01:07:50.220
The need is the justification.

01:07:50.660 --> 01:07:52.280
There are no other factors to consider.

01:07:52.740 --> 01:07:53.320
The need.

01:07:53.740 --> 01:07:56.520
You've just been looking for a convenient excuse, haven't you?

01:07:57.100 --> 01:07:59.620
Pilot's EEG dropping to 0.06.

01:07:59.780 --> 01:07:59.980
Repent!

01:08:01.436 --> 01:08:05.216
Unit zero is passing through bed two. She'll be coming in over the surface.

01:08:13.084 --> 01:08:17.164
that's the length of launching us unit zero is in position to throw target sighted error

01:08:17.164 --> 01:08:23.004
corrections have been made starting countdown 10 seconds till zero

01:08:46.280 --> 01:08:47.260
Target annihilated.

01:08:47.400 --> 01:08:49.000
AVA Unit 2 has been released.

01:08:49.240 --> 01:08:50.740
I need a status update on the Lance.

01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:52.200
It reached escape velocity.

01:08:52.520 --> 01:08:54.660
It's now moving into a lunar orbit, sir.

01:08:54.820 --> 01:08:57.220
So it's almost impossible to recover now.

01:08:57.420 --> 01:08:59.980
Right. There are no methods available for recovering an object.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:01.120
object of that much mass.

01:09:10.524 --> 01:09:12.624
Unit 2's psychograph is returning to normal.

01:09:13.052 --> 01:09:14.972
Return the body to the second cage.

01:09:15.196 --> 01:09:17.696
Returning body via access path 67.

01:09:18.204 --> 01:09:19.404
What's Oscar's status?

01:09:19.740 --> 01:09:21.600
We've confirmed that the pilot is alive.

01:09:21.884 --> 01:09:23.804
We put her in quarantine because of the contamination.

01:09:41.228 --> 01:09:42.328
I'm glad you're okay, Oscar.

01:09:43.148 --> 01:09:43.648
Shut up!

01:09:44.556 --> 01:09:45.396
It's okay.

01:09:46.348 --> 01:09:47.348
Could it get any worse?

01:09:48.364 --> 01:09:49.204
Little.

01:11:07.772 --> 01:11:10.492
Unit Zero becomes ensnared in an angelic trap.

01:11:10.852 --> 01:11:15.352
As the Angel's corrosive essence eats into the Ava's core, Ray makes the ultimate sacrifice.

01:11:15.804 --> 01:11:18.124
In a wave of heat and light, she becomes no more.

01:11:18.524 --> 01:11:19.524
It's the next episode.

01:11:20.028 --> 01:11:20.868
Tears.

01:11:33.160 --> 01:11:33.900
Daaaah

01:12:01.660 --> 01:12:05.890
I look at you, and I smile

01:12:05.890 --> 01:12:18.900
I don't care anymore

01:13:04.700 --> 01:13:06.130
Katuragi, it's me.

01:13:08.000 --> 01:13:11.210
This message, especially after I caused you so much trouble.

01:13:13.100 --> 01:13:14.780
Please tell Ritsu I'm sorry too.

01:13:15.660 --> 01:13:17.440
And there's one more thing to trouble you with.

01:13:18.440 --> 01:13:18.900
I've been growing.

01:13:21.130 --> 01:13:23.090
I'd appreciate it if you could water them for me.

01:13:24.010 --> 01:13:24.950
Shinji knows where they are.

01:13:26.260 --> 01:13:28.530
Katuragi, truth is with you.

01:13:29.690 --> 01:13:29.970
Don't hesitate.

01:13:30.060 --> 01:13:36.780
I can see you again. I will say the words that I could not say eight years ago.

01:13:41.100 --> 01:13:42.980
Another phone that will never ring.

01:13:48.280 --> 01:13:51.490
Misato's shutting herself off again, as usual.

01:13:56.410 --> 01:13:58.140
Is Asuka going to come back today?

01:14:07.200 --> 01:14:09.660
She'll skip school. She won't go home.

01:14:10.000 --> 01:14:11.900
All she does is play those games.

01:14:16.840 --> 01:14:17.490
Uh, yes?

01:14:18.480 --> 01:14:19.320
Can I sleep here?

01:14:20.440 --> 01:14:20.740
Yeah.

01:14:38.190 --> 01:14:41.310
I'm sorry I'm inconveniencing you.

01:14:41.490 --> 01:14:42.790
You're not inconvenient.

01:14:47.910 --> 01:14:49.550
Didn't win with my Ava.

01:14:50.320 --> 01:14:52.800
I lost whatever value I might have had.

01:14:53.640 --> 01:14:58.670
I hate, hate everything.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:01.870
And I hate myself the most.

01:15:03.300 --> 01:15:06.640
I don't care about anything anymore.

01:15:07.540 --> 01:15:08.540
There's no point.

01:15:08.920 --> 01:15:11.640
There's nothing to be ashamed of, Oscar.

01:15:11.980 --> 01:15:13.520
You did the best you could.

01:15:14.070 --> 01:15:15.230
You should be proud.

01:15:27.710 --> 01:15:29.270
So that child is gone.

01:15:30.730 --> 01:15:33.480
Yes, even cats die.

01:15:35.520 --> 01:15:36.660
Don't cry, Grandma.

01:15:38.140 --> 01:15:40.400
Yes, I'll come home as soon as I have time.

01:15:41.510 --> 01:15:43.570
I haven't visited Mother's grave in three years.

01:15:44.550 --> 01:15:47.500
Yes, I'll call you next time.

01:15:49.910 --> 01:15:51.940
Yeah, so even cats can die.

01:15:57.920 --> 01:15:59.880
It is impossible to write for you.

01:16:00.060 --> 01:16:03.060
Why did you use it?

01:16:03.060 --> 01:16:06.060
And about the Avis series, we don't have them all scheduled yet.

01:16:06.972 --> 01:16:09.392
Destroying the angels is our top priority.

01:16:09.692 --> 01:16:10.872
There was no other way.

01:16:11.420 --> 01:16:12.740
No other way.

01:16:13.308 --> 01:16:16.388
You'd better come up with a more believable excuse.

01:16:16.636 --> 01:16:20.056
Your actions these days belie a lack of respect for this committee.

01:16:21.820 --> 01:16:23.360
Biewski, I'm in conference.

01:16:26.204 --> 01:16:26.504
Understood.

01:16:28.444 --> 01:16:29.764
Another angel is approaching.

01:16:30.124 --> 01:16:31.304
We must finish this later.

01:16:31.884 --> 01:16:34.704
You're assuming you'll still have a seat here.

01:16:36.140 --> 01:16:36.860
How are you going to?

01:16:37.100 --> 01:16:38.040
I pray on Sikari.

01:16:40.940 --> 01:16:42.280
I'll be there in 15 minutes.

01:16:42.508 --> 01:16:44.468
Sort a unit zero through the 32nd gate.

01:16:44.812 --> 01:16:46.312
Use Unit 2 as the backup.

01:16:47.020 --> 01:16:50.820
No, I'm sorry. I don't have the authority to cancel the commander's freeze on unit one.

01:16:51.308 --> 01:16:51.808
That's right.

01:16:52.268 --> 01:16:53.108
Bye.

01:16:56.236 --> 01:16:57.376
Another angel, all right.

01:16:58.476 --> 01:16:58.796
Damn.

01:17:01.180 --> 01:17:03.640
Unit zero has launched, advancing to intercept.

01:17:04.000 --> 01:17:05.900
Unit two, remain in the launch bag.

01:17:06.300 --> 01:17:06.620
No.

01:17:06.940 --> 01:17:07.780
Move it out.

01:17:07.780 --> 01:17:08.600
What?

01:17:08.764 --> 01:17:09.484
No argument.

01:17:09.820 --> 01:17:11.680
It might be useful as a decoy, at least.

01:17:11.700 --> 01:17:11.940
Right.

01:17:13.372 --> 01:17:14.832
AVA Unit 2 ready to march.

01:17:15.836 --> 01:17:16.476
Here I am.

01:17:17.212 --> 01:17:17.412
in.

01:17:17.980 --> 01:17:20.100
Am I even linked to this thing anymore?

01:17:20.100 --> 01:17:21.980
Unit 2, advance to the 8th gate.

01:17:22.108 --> 01:17:24.888
Stand ready to move out as soon as your launch position is determined.

01:17:25.564 --> 01:17:28.404
Even if I go, I'll just be a burden on the other.

01:17:29.340 --> 01:17:30.000
Target approached.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:32.220
It's past the final intercept line at Gora.

01:17:32.300 --> 01:17:33.100
I just don't care.

01:17:43.040 --> 01:17:44.660
Target is above the Iwakidani Valley.

01:17:45.190 --> 01:17:46.290
Rotating in a fixed position.

01:17:47.420 --> 01:17:49.340
Target's AT field is still active.

01:17:50.930 --> 01:17:51.430
You bet.

01:17:51.570 --> 01:17:52.690
I'm sorry, no excuse.

01:17:53.110 --> 01:17:53.470
Report.

01:17:54.120 --> 01:17:55.880
It looks like we're in a stalemate, Major.

01:17:56.100 --> 01:17:56.680
He's right.

01:17:56.820 --> 01:17:59.720
The target's field pattern keeps cycling from blue to orange.

01:18:00.380 --> 01:18:00.640
What does it mean?

01:18:00.920 --> 01:18:02.860
The Magi aren't able to answer that question yet.

01:18:03.390 --> 01:18:05.670
We just don't have enough solid data right now.

01:18:05.910 --> 01:18:09.870
However, I'm certain that it's capable of assuming forms besides the one we see now.

01:18:10.360 --> 01:18:11.500
So we can't attack first.

01:18:12.570 --> 01:18:14.510
Great, let's hold back and study it for a bit.

01:18:14.920 --> 01:18:15.180
No.

01:18:31.948 --> 01:18:33.948
The target's affecting Unit Zero!

01:18:33.948 --> 01:18:35.948
What's the status on Unit Zero's AC field?

01:18:35.948 --> 01:18:38.948
Her AC field's up, but it's not stopping the Angel's energy probe!

01:18:38.948 --> 01:18:41.948
Is the Angel trying to establish first-level contact with Unit Zero?

01:18:42.604 --> 01:18:43.804
It must be!

01:19:05.884 --> 01:19:09.764
This isn't good. More than 5% has already undergone biofusion.

01:19:16.604 --> 01:19:18.604
and spread your AT field to maximum!

01:19:18.604 --> 01:19:21.604
Then fire your pellet gun into the target's vex section!

01:19:21.604 --> 01:19:22.604
AVA Unit 2!

01:19:25.980 --> 01:19:26.320
I'm going to do it.

01:19:30.760 --> 01:19:41.030
She's just the target, sitting out there! Get her back, now!

01:19:54.970 --> 01:19:59.860
Myself in the name? No, then somebody other than myself.

01:20:00.670 --> 01:20:01.310
Who are you?

01:20:01.690 --> 01:20:02.050
An angel.

01:20:02.950 --> 01:20:04.770
Are you one of the beings we call the angels?

01:20:06.320 --> 01:20:08.420
Don't you want to become one with me?

01:20:08.960 --> 01:20:09.400
No.

01:20:09.940 --> 01:20:11.400
I am me, not you.

01:20:12.310 --> 01:20:13.860
Do you show?

01:20:14.600 --> 01:20:15.420
It's too late.

01:20:20.200 --> 01:20:21.500
You're a part of my mind with me.

01:20:22.590 --> 01:20:24.150
Let me share with you these emotions.

01:20:27.970 --> 01:20:29.070
You feel this pain?

01:20:30.730 --> 01:20:33.260
This pain? No, it's different.

01:20:34.990 --> 01:20:37.920
Loneliness. Yes. Loneliness.

01:20:38.600 --> 01:20:40.900
Loneliness? Don't understand.

01:20:41.470 --> 01:20:43.490
You don't want to be by yourself, correct?

01:20:44.230 --> 01:20:46.040
We are many, but you are alone.

01:20:46.690 --> 01:20:47.830
You hate it, don't you?

01:20:48.940 --> 01:20:50.400
That is what it is to be.

01:20:52.060 --> 01:20:53.740
That is what your mind is.

01:20:54.010 --> 01:20:56.330
It is what fills your soul.

01:20:56.750 --> 01:20:58.150
You are that sorrow.

01:21:02.110 --> 01:21:12.000
I want Evangelion Unit 1 taken out of cryostasis.

01:21:12.220 --> 01:21:13.260
Launch it immediately.

01:21:13.800 --> 01:21:14.120
What?

01:21:14.380 --> 01:21:15.740
I said, launch it!

01:21:16.330 --> 01:21:16.630
Yes.

01:21:19.170 --> 01:21:20.170
Why for her?

01:21:20.490 --> 01:21:22.990
Am I so worthless you couldn't do this for me?

01:21:35.850 --> 01:21:36.730
Get way out of there now!

01:21:36.950 --> 01:21:37.210
Right!

01:21:39.280 --> 01:21:46.390
Break my mind and soul.

01:21:47.160 --> 01:21:48.440
Come on with Akari.

01:21:50.900 --> 01:21:51.880
We'll not...

01:21:51.880 --> 01:21:52.200
Break!

01:22:00.700 --> 01:22:07.200
I cannot. If I leave Unit Zero, the AT field will cease to be. I will not let it...

01:22:08.850 --> 01:22:11.200
Ray, do it!

01:22:11.400 --> 01:22:13.280
The core is collapsing. It's task critical.

01:22:45.550 --> 01:22:46.430
Operation is over.

01:22:47.080 --> 01:22:49.380
Downgrade alert status to condition yellow.

01:22:50.340 --> 01:22:53.180
Roger. Shifting alert status to condition yellow.

01:22:54.430 --> 01:22:56.050
What's the status of unit zero?

01:22:56.500 --> 01:22:57.500
I don't think.

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:22.300
now to rescue team if there's anything left to rescue dr akagi we've located the plug dr akagi

01:23:26.140 --> 01:23:29.940
classify everything here as top secret clean out the plug

01:23:30.380 --> 01:23:40.310
everything understood but now at last we have defeated all of the angels up to the 16th now

01:23:40.310 --> 01:23:47.920
there's only one left as it is written in Zele's Dead Sea Scrolls the promised times at hand the

01:23:47.920 --> 01:23:54.180
road has been long and sacrifices have been great true we have lost the Lance of Loginus

01:23:54.650 --> 01:23:59.960
and now unit zero that is sufficient reason for removing Ikari surely he must

01:24:00.060 --> 01:24:03.980
understood what the release of the Utsuki meant. We shall have to find another

01:24:03.980 --> 01:24:08.680
catspour to use against Ikari, and this one must know the truth.

01:24:32.590 --> 01:24:34.390
Shinji, may I come in?

01:24:41.740 --> 01:24:44.740
Sato, I can't cry anymore.

01:24:44.880 --> 01:24:47.810
I feel the pain, but the tears won't come.

01:24:48.760 --> 01:24:49.400
Why is that?

01:24:50.870 --> 01:24:54.390
Shinji, I don't know what to do or say.

01:24:55.460 --> 01:24:57.140
All I can do is be here for you.

01:24:57.300 --> 01:24:58.000
Don't touch me!

01:24:58.600 --> 01:24:59.980
Just, please...

01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:01.020
Leave me alone, Misato.

01:25:01.760 --> 01:25:02.700
I'm sorry.

01:25:07.820 --> 01:25:09.360
I know how lonely he must be.

01:25:10.250 --> 01:25:11.950
Does the fact that I'm a woman frighten him?

01:25:12.610 --> 01:25:14.450
Or is he afraid of getting close to anyone?

01:25:16.670 --> 01:25:18.160
Pen-Pen, come here.

01:25:22.450 --> 01:25:22.670
True.

01:25:23.380 --> 01:25:24.860
Anything is better than being alone.

01:25:25.530 --> 01:25:26.810
And I'm the one who's lonely.

01:25:40.650 --> 01:25:40.870
What?

01:25:43.030 --> 01:25:45.630
O'Donnie, First Internal Division, Dr. O'Donnie.

01:25:45.730 --> 01:25:47.630
Please call Conference Room 2, immediate.

01:25:49.510 --> 01:25:55.660
I'm so glad.

01:25:56.770 --> 01:25:58.010
I can't believe you're alive.

01:25:59.240 --> 01:25:59.980
Why isn't my...

01:26:02.240 --> 01:26:04.990
Anyway, thank you for saving my life.

01:26:05.470 --> 01:26:06.270
For doing what?

01:26:07.750 --> 01:26:10.860
You saved me by sacrificing Unit Zero.

01:26:11.760 --> 01:26:13.540
Oh, did I save you?

01:26:14.340 --> 01:26:15.480
Don't you remember?

01:26:17.360 --> 01:26:18.400
I just don't know.

01:26:19.320 --> 01:26:21.680
I think I must be the third one.

01:26:54.480 --> 01:26:55.740
Missed for the first time

01:27:01.180 --> 01:27:04.100
What am I crying? What am I crying for?

01:27:05.400 --> 01:27:11.010
Yes, that's right. Put a hold on Ray's, on the first child's current status.

01:27:12.150 --> 01:27:13.880
Just keep your eyes on him.

01:27:15.360 --> 01:27:19.520
The fact that Ray is even alive is likely to cause a great deal of trouble with Chairman Gill.

01:27:20.230 --> 01:27:24.710
I've given the old men of Zaylay something else to look at. There is no problem.

01:27:26.420 --> 01:27:29.980
It is our intent to carry out this inquisition and a dignified...

01:27:31.020 --> 01:27:33.800
It is not our intent to bring any shame upon you.

01:27:34.090 --> 01:27:36.050
I don't feel any shame.

01:27:36.590 --> 01:27:37.670
She's a strong woman.

01:27:37.930 --> 01:27:40.490
I can see why Ikari wants to keep her next to him.

01:27:40.880 --> 01:27:42.500
However, what are you aware?

01:27:42.620 --> 01:27:46.380
The one who sent you here was none other than Ikari himself.

01:27:47.360 --> 01:27:50.160
He refused our request for the pilot of Unit Zero

01:27:50.160 --> 01:27:54.160
and has sent you here in her stead, Dr. Ikari.

01:27:55.070 --> 01:27:55.270
Me?

01:27:58.480 --> 01:27:59.240
Away to the truth.

01:27:59.600 --> 01:27:59.980
Do you want...

01:28:00.920 --> 01:28:07.620
sent by 36 other methods, but they won't reach you. The only way that is guaranteed is this capsule.

01:28:09.020 --> 01:28:15.920
This is all I have. Now it's completely up to you as to how to use this. Passcode is our first

01:28:15.920 --> 01:28:29.940
memory. Goodbye, and take care. I live falling no longer, not since you gave me your heart and soul.

01:28:33.610 --> 01:28:36.670
So, has Dr. Akagi's deposition proved acceptable?

01:28:36.950 --> 01:28:40.500
She is not like Piuski. It is more beneficial for us to release her.

01:28:40.900 --> 01:28:44.380
The woman has rendered a remarkable service to the Evangelians.

01:28:44.580 --> 01:28:46.980
They are continuing to be of use for a while.

01:28:47.160 --> 01:28:48.460
For the future of mankind.

01:28:48.740 --> 01:28:52.320
As for the Evangelians themselves, there are now eight under construction.

01:28:52.720 --> 01:28:54.300
And four that are not.

01:28:54.600 --> 01:28:58.240
The disappearance of Tokyo-3 will prove to be a boon to the project.

01:28:58.670 --> 01:28:59.970
We must accelerate the comp-

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:03.620
of that day. The promised time will be at hand.

01:29:07.880 --> 01:29:08.100
Hello?

01:29:08.440 --> 01:29:09.580
Listen to me carefully.

01:29:11.040 --> 01:29:13.560
The next few minutes, you'll be free from the Secret Service.

01:29:14.100 --> 01:29:15.840
Come here now while you can.

01:29:16.020 --> 01:29:16.400
Rizko?

01:29:29.030 --> 01:29:29.970
Sorry, it won't work.

01:29:30.000 --> 01:29:36.240
without my password I see did Kaji arrange this show them to me all the

01:29:36.240 --> 01:29:40.040
secrets you've buried here all right but this one will see them as well

01:30:02.560 --> 01:30:04.200
This looks just like Rey's room.

01:30:04.840 --> 01:30:05.820
That's not surprising.

01:30:06.480 --> 01:30:08.260
This is the place where Rey was born.

01:30:08.460 --> 01:30:09.280
She was what?

01:30:09.660 --> 01:30:10.920
She was born here.

01:30:11.340 --> 01:30:14.360
The visions of light and water that stream through her consciousness

01:30:14.360 --> 01:30:16.600
are merely reflections of this place.

01:30:17.620 --> 01:30:20.200
Dr. Akagi, this isn't what I came to see.

01:30:21.250 --> 01:30:23.050
I know that, Misato.

01:30:27.300 --> 01:30:28.720
That Aunt Ava?

01:30:28.920 --> 01:30:29.720
The first one.

01:30:30.250 --> 01:30:37.990
failure we abandoned it ten years ago a graveyard for avos nothing that elaborate just a dumping

01:30:37.990 --> 01:30:44.300
ground it's also the place where your mother was taken from you you may not remember it but you

01:30:44.300 --> 01:30:49.220
were watching at the very moment when your mother disappeared do you remember that shinji doctor

01:30:58.600 --> 01:30:59.960
This is the core of a dumb...

01:31:00.160 --> 01:31:02.640
This is where we produce the components.

01:31:09.260 --> 01:31:10.590
Oh my god! It's Ray!

01:31:12.420 --> 01:31:13.480
They're all Ray!

01:31:13.720 --> 01:31:15.380
You mean the dummy plugs are...

01:31:15.380 --> 01:31:17.820
Uh-huh. These are the cores of the dummy plugs.

01:31:18.090 --> 01:31:19.930
They're what makes the system work.

01:31:20.110 --> 01:31:20.750
Who are they?

01:31:21.130 --> 01:31:23.590
These? These are empty vessels.

01:31:24.280 --> 01:31:26.900
Nothing but spare parts and spare rays.

01:31:30.000 --> 01:31:35.720
Mankind found a god and man, in his folly, tried to make the god his toy.

01:31:36.500 --> 01:31:39.080
For that arrogance, mankind was punished.

01:31:40.080 --> 01:31:45.570
That happened 15 years ago, and the god that man found was lost.

01:31:46.610 --> 01:31:51.940
But man continues to attempt to resurrect the god from that god, Adam.

01:31:52.740 --> 01:31:58.220
Man attempted to make a man who was like a god himself, and that was Ava.

01:31:58.540 --> 01:31:58.840
What?

01:32:00.000 --> 01:32:00.840
Avas are human?

01:32:01.390 --> 01:32:01.790
Yes.

01:32:02.770 --> 01:32:05.650
Inside the empty shell of each Ava is a human soul.

01:32:06.400 --> 01:32:09.220
But the only vessel which can hold a soul is Ray.

01:32:10.060 --> 01:32:12.220
These things are empty husks.

01:32:12.790 --> 01:32:14.030
They have no souls.

01:32:14.250 --> 01:32:15.590
No right to live.

01:32:15.950 --> 01:32:19.200
The room of God is empty.

01:32:23.160 --> 01:32:24.180
Stop it!

01:32:24.360 --> 01:32:26.000
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

01:32:26.540 --> 01:32:28.140
Yes, I know.

01:32:29.140 --> 01:32:29.980
I'm just...

01:32:30.540 --> 01:32:59.960
to them. These aren't human, just things with human forms, but even so, he's not a dog. I could have suffered any humiliation, endured any torture, but he had already chosen. God, I'm a mother and my daughter, fool to the end. If you want to kill me,

01:33:05.830 --> 01:33:09.090
If that's what you want, you are a fool.

01:33:17.850 --> 01:33:22.090
What is this curse that consumes those who come into contact with Ava?

01:34:05.080 --> 01:34:05.640
And make

01:34:34.860 --> 01:34:37.200
The city is gone. His friends have left.

01:34:37.460 --> 01:34:39.240
Now a boy comes upon Shinji.

01:34:39.420 --> 01:34:42.080
His smile melts its way into Shinji's frozen heart.

01:34:42.660 --> 01:34:45.300
Destiny's cruel fingers, however, have a tragedy in store.

01:34:45.880 --> 01:34:48.140
It's the next episode. The final messenger.

01:35:32.140 --> 01:35:39.210
Thank you for watching until the end.

01:36:31.850 --> 01:36:43.880
I'm my secret. Now, now, I'm without Papa.

01:37:01.150 --> 01:37:11.640
I can't help any of my affairs about me anymore, father, my mother.

01:37:21.980 --> 01:37:24.080
Are you Oscar Langley, so are you.

01:37:25.860 --> 01:37:29.280
Intelligence Division 2 just took the second child into protective custody.

01:37:30.000 --> 01:37:34.800
Right. It isn't like them to lose her in the first place, and then it takes seven days to find her.

01:37:34.980 --> 01:37:38.900
They must have done it on purpose. They're trying to make trouble for us, aren't they, Major?

01:37:39.020 --> 01:37:45.600
It could be. And a fifth child arrives to replace Asuka today. This whole thing is just too convenient.

01:37:55.060 --> 01:37:59.980
I mean, there's a feeling about her, almost as if my...

01:38:00.030 --> 01:38:02.690
Mother, Ray, and my mother.

01:38:04.510 --> 01:38:07.410
What are you doing with them, Father?

01:38:09.200 --> 01:38:10.650
Hello, Commander.

01:38:12.080 --> 01:38:16.150
Did you know my cat, the cat my grandmother was taking care of?

01:38:16.690 --> 01:38:20.370
I hadn't seen it for a long time, but now I know that I'll never see it.

01:38:20.960 --> 01:38:22.640
Why did you destroy the dummy system?

01:38:23.360 --> 01:38:26.120
It wasn't the dummy system that I destroyed.

01:38:26.950 --> 01:38:27.930
It was Ray.

01:38:28.700 --> 01:38:29.920
I'll ask you once more.

01:38:30.410 --> 01:38:31.510
Why did you do it?

01:38:32.170 --> 01:38:33.430
I'm not happy anymore.

01:38:34.770 --> 01:38:36.730
Not even when you make love to me.

01:38:37.670 --> 01:38:41.880
Do what with me before.

01:38:42.860 --> 01:38:43.720
You disappointed me.

01:38:44.620 --> 01:38:47.180
You had no hope or expectations of me to...

01:38:58.600 --> 01:38:59.500
You disappeared too.

01:39:02.650 --> 01:39:04.290
But what can I even talk to her about?

01:39:04.660 --> 01:39:06.320
Could I talk about Ayanami with her?

01:39:08.680 --> 01:39:17.780
All of my friends, Tochi, all of their homes have been destroyed and now they've left friends.

01:39:19.260 --> 01:39:21.480
I don't have anybody left. I could call my friend.

01:39:23.350 --> 01:39:27.090
But I can't go see Ayanami again.

01:39:28.400 --> 01:39:29.700
I don't have courage to face her.

01:39:30.890 --> 01:39:33.350
I don't even know how to talk or act around her now.

01:39:36.740 --> 01:39:40.210
Misato, Mother, what can I do?

01:39:41.600 --> 01:39:42.540
What can I do?

01:40:01.830 --> 01:40:04.820
The song is good.

01:40:05.600 --> 01:40:09.230
Singing brings joy and revitalizes the human soul.

01:40:09.550 --> 01:40:12.430
I think that song is the highest achievement of the Lilam culture.

01:40:12.630 --> 01:40:15.100
Don't you agree, Shinji Akari?

01:40:15.890 --> 01:40:16.930
How do you know my name?

01:40:17.840 --> 01:40:19.160
Everyone knows your name.

01:40:19.790 --> 01:40:23.210
I don't mean to sound rude, but you're rather ignorant of your own position.

01:40:23.920 --> 01:40:25.830
Oh, really? Who are you?

01:40:26.420 --> 01:40:29.980
I am Kaoru. Kaoru Nagisa. I am like you.

01:40:30.000 --> 01:40:37.640
one of the selected children the fifth child you're the fifth child um mr nagisa call me

01:40:37.640 --> 01:40:51.660
karu mr ikari mr ikari oh no you can call me shinji fifth child has just arrived karu nagisa

01:40:52.040 --> 01:40:57.490
karu of the seashore and all of his past records have been erased like ray but at least one record

01:40:57.490 --> 01:40:59.910
remains he was born on the same day second

01:41:00.570 --> 01:41:03.860
The committee sent him directly to us. There must be something else.

01:41:04.430 --> 01:41:06.950
The Marduk report's file on the fifth child was classified.

01:41:07.540 --> 01:41:10.280
So I hacked into the intelligence department's computer system.

01:41:10.560 --> 01:41:11.760
I can't believe you did that.

01:41:12.060 --> 01:41:13.080
Well, it was worth doing.

01:41:14.450 --> 01:41:15.940
Found out where Ritsuko is.

01:41:17.350 --> 01:41:19.690
So what do you want to do about the fifth child's sync tests?

01:41:20.440 --> 01:41:22.380
I don't have any tricks up my sleeve this time.

01:41:23.430 --> 01:41:24.310
See what he can do.

01:41:27.180 --> 01:41:28.820
Take it down 0.3 more.

01:41:29.270 --> 01:41:29.730
Yes, sir.

01:41:31.050 --> 01:41:32.530
Are these data readouts correct?

01:41:33.000 --> 01:41:35.280
All of the test systems are operating correctly, sir.

01:41:36.420 --> 01:41:38.440
The Magi confirmed that there are no data errors.

01:41:39.210 --> 01:41:43.650
It's incredible that he can synchronize with Unit 2 even before we've reconfigured the core.

01:41:44.330 --> 01:41:45.150
He's amazing.

01:41:46.610 --> 01:41:48.210
But this isn't possible.

01:41:49.200 --> 01:41:50.280
Nevertheless, it's happening.

01:41:50.880 --> 01:41:54.200
We must accept that fact and start an investigation into why it is so.

01:42:00.000 --> 01:42:01.760
You must be the first child, am I correct?

01:42:03.320 --> 01:42:07.500
You're Rei Ayanami. You are the same as I am.

01:42:08.440 --> 01:42:09.280
Identify yourself.

01:42:10.720 --> 01:42:14.000
The fifth child has made contact with Rei. I see.

01:42:14.580 --> 01:42:18.260
The Magi are currently analyzing the nature of the fifth and what his powers may be.

01:42:18.670 --> 01:42:21.190
And we still don't know who or what he is.

01:42:22.360 --> 01:42:23.140
Who in the hell is this?

01:42:31.400 --> 01:42:36.050
Tenji hasn't come back yet either. I guess I'm not deserving of trust.

01:42:39.670 --> 01:42:43.430
Central Dogma is now open. Please use Route 3 for the transfer.

01:42:43.610 --> 01:42:46.190
Hello. You weren't waiting here for me, were you?

01:42:46.820 --> 01:42:49.420
No. Well, not really waiting anyway.

01:42:49.880 --> 01:42:51.760
So what are you doing for the rest of the day?

01:42:52.400 --> 01:42:56.360
Well, usually when tests are over, I'll just take a shower and go home.

01:42:57.220 --> 01:42:59.460
But I don't really want to go home these days.

01:43:00.120 --> 01:43:04.550
The fact that you have a place where you could return home will lead you to happiness.

01:43:04.610 --> 01:43:06.040
That is a good fact.

01:43:07.020 --> 01:43:07.720
You think so?

01:43:08.000 --> 01:43:09.660
I want to talk to you some more.

01:43:10.230 --> 01:43:11.150
May I come with you?

01:43:11.500 --> 01:43:13.190
To the shower, I mean.

01:43:13.390 --> 01:43:14.690
Aren't you going to go to the shower?

01:43:15.250 --> 01:43:15.690
Yeah.

01:43:16.240 --> 01:43:17.280
Or do you mean no?

01:43:18.260 --> 01:43:20.060
No, I don't mean no.

01:43:26.900 --> 01:43:29.960
You are extremely afraid of any kind of initial con...

01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:44.380
Don't you? Are you that afraid of other people? I know that by keeping others at a distance, you avoid a betrayal of your trust, but while you may not be hurt that way, you mustn't forget that you must endure the loneliness.

01:43:45.000 --> 01:43:50.320
Man can never completely erase this sadness because all men are fundamentally alone.

01:43:51.360 --> 01:43:59.630
It's time.

01:44:00.600 --> 01:44:01.240
Time to go?

01:44:01.560 --> 01:44:03.750
Yeah, I have to go to bed.

01:44:04.550 --> 01:44:05.010
With me?

01:44:05.710 --> 01:44:09.630
No, I think you have your own room that they gave you, I mean.

01:44:10.560 --> 01:44:10.860
Okay.

01:44:12.860 --> 01:44:15.880
You know, pain is something that man must endure in his heart.

01:44:17.260 --> 01:44:20.960
And since the heart feels pain so easily, some believe life is pain.

01:44:21.880 --> 01:44:23.360
You are delicate like glass.

01:44:23.930 --> 01:44:25.400
That is, your heart is.

01:44:25.710 --> 01:44:26.130
It is?

01:44:26.530 --> 01:44:26.810
Yes.

01:44:27.380 --> 01:44:28.860
This is worth earning my empathy.

01:44:30.540 --> 01:44:31.740
I'm saying I love you.

01:44:42.270 --> 01:44:46.230
The nerve organization was established to execute the wishes of Zele.

01:44:46.430 --> 01:44:49.790
It was intended to enact the scenario we had created.

01:44:50.030 --> 01:44:54.090
However, it appears to have become dominated by a single zealous individual.

01:44:54.290 --> 01:44:57.460
Yes, it has. We must take it back into our own dominion.

01:44:57.560 --> 01:44:58.480
It is time.

01:44:58.680 --> 01:44:59.820
We must restore nerve.

01:45:00.060 --> 01:45:02.960
in the Ava series to their proper role.

01:45:03.340 --> 01:45:06.360
Ikari, you will take responsibility for betraying Sele.

01:45:07.560 --> 01:45:09.300
I'm afraid there's not much time left

01:45:09.300 --> 01:45:10.660
for accomplishing our goal.

01:45:10.940 --> 01:45:12.480
However, the Lance of Longinus,

01:45:12.480 --> 01:45:14.660
which would have impeded the realization of our plan,

01:45:14.780 --> 01:45:15.860
is now gone forever.

01:45:16.380 --> 01:45:18.020
The Last Angel shall soon appear,

01:45:18.060 --> 01:45:18.920
and with its destruction,

01:45:19.060 --> 01:45:22.310
our wishes may be born soon, patient.

01:45:24.790 --> 01:45:25.730
Why am I here?

01:45:27.850 --> 01:45:29.190
Why am I still alive?

01:45:31.280 --> 01:45:31.920
But what purpose?

01:45:33.620 --> 01:45:34.400
For whose purpose?

01:45:39.630 --> 01:45:40.610
What way are he and I?

01:45:44.480 --> 01:45:47.260
Thank God this apartment block is on the outskirts of town.

01:45:48.190 --> 01:45:49.690
Miracle that it and you survived.

01:45:49.770 --> 01:45:52.900
I can't guarantee your safety any longer.

01:45:53.870 --> 01:45:58.280
So the Haraki family will be taking care of you from now on.

01:46:00.190 --> 01:46:02.390
I may not see you for a while, Pen-Pen.

01:46:10.450 --> 01:46:12.030
I think I should sleep on the floor.

01:46:12.820 --> 01:46:14.920
No, I'm staying at your place.

01:46:15.160 --> 01:46:15.740
I'm fine.

01:46:16.020 --> 01:46:17.300
I'll be okay on the floor.

01:46:17.420 --> 01:46:22.810
What did you want to say to me?

01:46:23.480 --> 01:46:23.720
What?

01:46:24.710 --> 01:46:26.890
You wanted to tell me something, didn't you?

01:46:28.660 --> 01:46:29.720
So much has happened.

01:46:30.440 --> 01:46:31.140
Since I came.

01:46:32.400 --> 01:46:34.830
Before this, I lived with my teacher.

01:46:36.020 --> 01:46:38.160
It was calm and boring in those days.

01:46:38.760 --> 01:46:40.040
I wasn't really doing anything.

01:46:41.410 --> 01:46:42.570
But I was fine with that.

01:46:43.980 --> 01:46:45.680
There was really nothing that I had to do.

01:46:46.660 --> 01:46:47.980
Did you hate dealing with people?

01:46:48.460 --> 01:46:49.280
More or less.

01:46:49.820 --> 01:46:51.400
But I didn't really care as much.

01:46:51.620 --> 01:46:53.380
However, I really hated my father.

01:46:55.100 --> 01:46:57.020
Why am I telling all of this to Kaoru?

01:47:00.280 --> 01:47:04.630
I think I may have been born just to meet you, Shinji Akari.

01:47:05.700 --> 01:47:07.240
Well, did you get the data on him?

01:47:07.690 --> 01:47:08.960
Yeah, this is it.

01:47:09.520 --> 01:47:11.880
I sort of borrowed it from Lieutenant Ibuki without asking.

01:47:13.200 --> 01:47:14.940
I'm sorry that I made you do something like that.

01:47:16.860 --> 01:47:17.500
What is this?

01:47:17.920 --> 01:47:20.730
Yeah, it's no wonder that Maya can't talk about this.

01:47:20.830 --> 01:47:22.840
It's not even theoretically possible.

01:47:23.330 --> 01:47:25.410
Yeah, it's getting more and more mysterious.

01:47:26.690 --> 01:47:29.290
How can he set his sync ratio to any level he chooses?

01:47:30.860 --> 01:47:32.840
I guess it's time to go Maverick again.

01:47:34.380 --> 01:47:35.380
It's you again.

01:47:35.890 --> 01:47:36.730
How surprising.

01:47:37.400 --> 01:47:38.500
I have a question for you.

01:47:39.030 --> 01:47:41.430
Our conversation is being monitored, you know.

01:47:41.550 --> 01:47:42.270
I don't care.

01:47:42.980 --> 01:47:43.560
You're the child.

01:47:43.820 --> 01:47:44.260
What is he?

01:47:45.490 --> 01:47:46.910
He is probably the last.

01:47:49.960 --> 01:47:50.680
It is time.

01:47:50.900 --> 01:47:54.340
Let us go, Adam Stark's shadow, servant of the Lilam.

01:48:02.780 --> 01:48:04.260
That's impossible! Where's our-

01:48:05.020 --> 01:48:07.040
She's in room 303, I've confirmed it!

01:48:07.240 --> 01:48:07.880
Who the hell?!

01:48:10.270 --> 01:48:12.650
The entry plug hasn't even been inserted into Unit 2!

01:48:13.310 --> 01:48:15.550
Unmanned? And the fifth child isn't there?

01:48:17.140 --> 01:48:19.490
AT field detected in Central Dogma!

01:48:19.800 --> 01:48:20.400
Ava 2?

01:48:20.680 --> 01:48:22.140
No, the blood pattern is blue!

01:48:22.340 --> 01:48:23.540
It's definitely an angel!

01:48:23.640 --> 01:48:24.460
It's an angel?!

01:48:26.080 --> 01:48:27.630
That means it's a ghost.

01:48:30.160 --> 01:48:33.560
The target has passed from the fourth defensive layer, and it's still descending.

01:48:33.800 --> 01:48:36.440
It's no good. We can't cut the power to the linear carriage.

01:48:36.760 --> 01:48:40.220
Evacuate the area. Seal all shotters and bulkheads surrounding Central Dogma.

01:48:40.400 --> 01:48:42.140
We've got to buy ourselves some more time.

01:48:42.850 --> 01:48:47.730
Closing all bulkheads immediately. All personnel evacuate. All personnel evacuate.

01:48:48.150 --> 01:48:51.210
God have mercy. Sele has sent an angel to us.

01:48:51.730 --> 01:48:55.410
The old man wants to advance his schedule, using us as his tools.

01:48:56.330 --> 01:48:59.970
The last angel has intruded into the Central Dogma. It is now...

01:49:00.000 --> 01:49:02.700
now descending exactly as we planned.

01:49:03.260 --> 01:49:06.340
Ikari, you were our good friend, our comrade,

01:49:06.440 --> 01:49:07.980
an understanding collaborator.

01:49:08.280 --> 01:49:10.880
However, this shall be your final task.

01:49:11.290 --> 01:49:13.210
Now you must use Unit 1.

01:49:15.760 --> 01:49:18.040
Unit 2 has penetrated the armored shutters.

01:49:18.180 --> 01:49:20.320
Target has penetrated the second barrier, sir.

01:49:20.580 --> 01:49:22.220
Send Unit 1 in to pursue it.

01:49:22.640 --> 01:49:23.100
Yes, sir.

01:49:23.580 --> 01:49:25.580
Under all circumstances, the last angel

01:49:25.580 --> 01:49:27.680
must be kept from entering terminal dogma.

01:49:31.820 --> 01:49:33.480
Why did the Angel take Unit 2?

01:49:33.740 --> 01:49:36.560
You don't think it's going to attempt to fuse with Unit 2, do you?

01:49:36.860 --> 01:49:39.280
Or will it try to bring about our total destruction?

01:49:40.000 --> 01:49:42.600
No! No! No! It's not possible!

01:49:45.050 --> 01:49:51.070
It's a fact that you must accept. It's a pair for combat. Do you understand?

01:49:53.470 --> 01:49:54.950
Shinji, you are late.

01:49:55.460 --> 01:49:59.580
Edit Unit 1, rescinding via access route 2. It's about to make contact with the target.

01:50:00.570 --> 01:50:05.630
You betrayed me! You betrayed the trust I placed in you! You betrayed me just like my father did!

01:50:05.730 --> 01:50:08.450
You didn't want us to reach the fourth layer! It's about to confront the target!

01:50:08.650 --> 01:50:09.110
There he is!

01:50:11.120 --> 01:50:12.580
I've been waiting for you, Shinji.

01:50:13.000 --> 01:50:13.400
GAURU!

01:50:22.200 --> 01:50:26.700
The Ava series was born from Adam, born from man's antithesis,

01:50:26.800 --> 01:50:29.980
and yet the Lilum will utilize that which they hate most of all in the...

01:50:30.000 --> 01:50:42.150
order to survive. I do not understand. Avas and I are composed of the same matter. Born from Adam,

01:50:42.350 --> 01:50:47.710
I can synchronize with it easily as long as there is no dominant soul. And Unit 2's soul is now

01:50:47.710 --> 01:50:57.240
hiding itself. Thus, Ava 2 is mine. Yes, at least that is what you Lilam call this thing. This is

01:50:57.240 --> 01:50:59.980
the light of my soul, a sacred territory in which no...

01:51:00.030 --> 01:51:05.770
one may intrude aren't you lilam even aware yet that your so-called at field is merely that wall

01:51:05.770 --> 01:51:15.250
that encloses every mind that exists both avas have penetrated all the way down to the final

01:51:15.250 --> 01:51:20.270
layer 20 seconds until the target reach if unit one signals cut off or disappear so if any other

01:51:20.270 --> 01:51:24.520
change should occur for the worse i know i'll initiate the self-destruct for this entire

01:51:24.520 --> 01:51:29.960
facility it's better than letting third impact take place i'm sorry it's all right

01:51:30.540 --> 01:51:32.620
Dying beside you wouldn't be a bad way to go out.

01:51:32.780 --> 01:51:33.320
Thank you.

01:51:34.000 --> 01:51:40.340
This is mankind's fate.

01:51:40.870 --> 01:51:43.870
The thread of human hope is spun with the flax of song.

01:51:44.500 --> 01:51:51.290
It's shutting out everything.

01:51:51.550 --> 01:51:53.830
Light, magnetism, subatomic particles.

01:51:54.090 --> 01:51:57.360
It's blocking every target.

01:52:32.140 --> 01:52:33.960
They've reached it. Heaven's door is open.

01:52:35.610 --> 01:52:37.890
Then the angel has finally reached its goal.

01:52:38.870 --> 01:52:39.450
Get ready.

01:52:47.910 --> 01:52:48.950
Another AT field.

01:52:49.050 --> 01:52:52.230
A field as strong as the first one has appeared around Terminal Dogma.

01:52:52.830 --> 01:52:55.430
He's right. It's breaking through the other AT field.

01:52:55.670 --> 01:52:57.190
What is it? Another angel?

01:52:57.900 --> 01:52:59.800
I don't know. I can't confirm it.

01:53:00.380 --> 01:53:01.460
God! It just disappeared!

01:53:02.280 --> 01:53:03.730
Disappeared? The angel?

01:53:06.390 --> 01:53:12.150
Adam, that from which we came, must one who is born from Adam return to Adam?

01:53:12.690 --> 01:53:14.510
Even though it will destroy man?

01:53:16.080 --> 01:53:19.220
Wait, this isn't... Lilith?

01:53:19.690 --> 01:53:22.640
I see! I understand now! The Lilith!

01:53:37.160 --> 01:53:43.890
